---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Marketing Renegades | Install Your Marketing System"
  description="Marketing Renegades helps independent business owners install simple, repeatable marketing systems. Get the software, playbooks, and support to market consistently for $99/month."
>
  <div class="page">
    <Header />

    <main>
      <!-- HERO -->
      <header class="home-hero">
        <div class="home-glow"></div>
        <div class="wrap home-hero-in rv">
          <span class="ey">Simple marketing systems for independent business owners</span>
          <h1 class="disp">
            <span>Install your</span>
            <span class="gold">marketing system.</span>
          </h1>
          <p class="price-line">$99/month. Software included.</p>
          <p class="home-lead">Follow up faster. Work your database. Generate new opportunities. Ask for reviews and referrals. Stay visible. Do the important stuff <strong>consistently</strong> — without trying to remember everything yourself.</p>
          <div class="hero-cta">
            <a class="btn btn-gold" href="/crm">See the $99 system <span class="ar">→</span></a>
            <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="https://community.gorenegades.com">Join the free community</a>
          </div>
          <p class="hero-note">No giant course vault. No complicated tech stack. Just the system, the playbooks, and the tools to run it.</p>
        </div>
      </header>

      <div class="marquee" aria-hidden="true"><div class="mq-track">
        <span>Database <span class="sl">/</span> New Leads <span class="sl">/</span> Follow-Up <span class="sl">/</span> Reviews <span class="sl">/</span> Referrals <span class="sl">/</span> Content <span class="sl">/</span> Go Renegades <span class="sl">/</span> </span><span>Database <span class="sl">/</span> New Leads <span class="sl">/</span> Follow-Up <span class="sl">/</span> Reviews <span class="sl">/</span> Referrals <span class="sl">/</span> Content <span class="sl">/</span> Go Renegades <span class="sl">/</span> </span>
      </div></div>

      <!-- CONSISTENCY -->
      <section class="sec sec-ink">
        <div class="narrow rv">
          <span class="ey">The real problem</span>
          <h2 class="disp">Most businesses don't have a marketing knowledge problem. <span class="g">They have a consistency problem.</span></h2>
          <p class="sec-lead">Most owners already know a lot of the things they should be doing. The problem is doing them week after week while also running the business.</p>

          <div class="consistency-list">
            <div><span>01</span><p>Respond to new leads quickly.</p></div>
            <div><span>02</span><p>Follow up until people are actually ready.</p></div>
            <div><span>03</span><p>Stay in touch with past clients and your database.</p></div>
            <div><span>04</span><p>Ask for reviews and referrals.</p></div>
            <div><span>05</span><p>Show up consistently with useful content and offers.</p></div>
            <div><span>06</span><p>Keep referral partners engaged instead of hoping they remember you.</p></div>
          </div>

          <div class="pullquote">
            <p>I'm not naturally great at consistency either. That's exactly why I like systems. <strong>The system remembers when I don't.</strong></p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- PODS -->
      <section class="sec sec-black" id="system">
        <div class="wrap">
          <div class="rv section-intro">
            <span class="ey">Your marketing system</span>
            <h2 class="disp">Six simple areas. <span class="g">One connected system.</span></h2>
            <p class="sec-lead">We organize the work into practical marketing Pods. You don't need to master everything at once. Get the core pieces running, then improve them over time.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="pod-grid rv">
            <article class="pod-card">
              <div class="pod-num">01</div>
              <h3>Database Marketing</h3>
              <p>Turn the people you already know into an active marketing asset with regular email, personal check-ins, reactivation, reviews, referrals, and useful follow-up.</p>
            </article>

            <article class="pod-card">
              <div class="pod-num">02</div>
              <h3>Generating New Leads</h3>
              <p>Create simple campaigns and offers that bring new people into your world instead of depending entirely on referrals or waiting for the phone to ring.</p>
            </article>

            <article class="pod-card">
              <div class="pod-num">03</div>
              <h3>Lead Follow-Up</h3>
              <p>Respond quickly, nurture automatically, organize opportunities, and make sure good leads don't quietly disappear because everyone got busy.</p>
            </article>

            <article class="pod-card">
              <div class="pod-num">04</div>
              <h3>Reviews & Referrals</h3>
              <p>Build the ask into the process so happy customers become reviews, introductions, repeat business, and future opportunities.</p>
            </article>

            <article class="pod-card">
              <div class="pod-num">05</div>
              <h3>Content & Visibility</h3>
              <p>Create a realistic rhythm for email, social content, video, and useful communication so your market keeps seeing and hearing from you.</p>
            </article>

            <article class="pod-card">
              <div class="pod-num">06</div>
              <h3>Referral Partners</h3>
              <p>Stay useful and visible to the people who can send business through meetings, joint campaigns, events, content, and consistent communication.</p>
            </article>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- $99 OFFER -->
      <section class="system-offer">
        <div class="wrap system-offer-grid rv">
          <div>
            <span class="ey">Renegade CRM</span>
            <h2 class="disp">The system + the software. <span>$99/month.</span></h2>
            <p class="offer-lead">Renegade CRM gives your marketing somewhere to live. Contacts, pipelines, email, text, automations, calendars, forms, campaigns, reviews, social tools, and more — all connected to the playbooks we're teaching.</p>
            <p class="offer-copy">The point isn't to buy another CRM and stare at an empty dashboard. We show you the marketing systems to install, give you practical playbooks and templates, and give you the software to actually run them.</p>
            <div class="hero-cta">
              <a class="btn btn-gold" href="/crm">See Renegade CRM <span class="ar">→</span></a>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="price-card">
            <div class="price-kicker">Renegade CRM</div>
            <div class="price"><span>$</span>99</div>
            <div class="price-period">per month</div>
            <div class="price-rule"></div>
            <p>Marketing system + software + Renegade playbooks.</p>
            <div class="price-note">Start simple. Add capability as you need it.</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- ACADEMY -->
      <section class="sec sec-ink">
        <div class="wrap academy-grid rv">
          <div>
            <span class="ey">Want help building it?</span>
            <h2 class="disp">That's what <span class="g">Renegade Academy</span> is for.</h2>
            <p class="sec-lead">You don't pay Academy tuition because we're hiding the good information. The playbooks and ideas are available to the community.</p>
            <p class="academy-copy">You join the Academy because you want structure, live help, classmates, accountability, and dedicated time to actually build the system in your real business.</p>
            <a class="btn btn-gold" href="/academy">Explore Renegade Academy <span class="ar">→</span></a>
          </div>
          <div class="academy-points">
            <div><span>01</span><div><strong>Learn it live.</strong><p>Understand the strategy without disappearing into a giant course library.</p></div></div>
            <div><span>02</span><div><strong>Build it together.</strong><p>Open the software, create the campaign, wire up the follow-up, and make it usable.</p></div></div>
            <div><span>03</span><div><strong>Leave with capability.</strong><p>The goal isn't dependence on Renegades. It's becoming better at operating your own marketing.</p></div></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- FREE COMMUNITY -->
      <section class="community-section">
        <div class="wrap community-grid rv">
          <div>
            <span class="ey">Free is a perfectly good place to start</span>
            <h2 class="disp">Join the <span>Renegades.</span></h2>
            <p>You don't have to buy anything to start getting useful ideas. Join the free community and use what helps.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="free-list">
            <div><span>+</span> Marketing Playbooks</div>
            <div><span>+</span> Renegade Power Hours</div>
            <div><span>+</span> Live classes and discussions</div>
            <div><span>+</span> Templates, examples, and prompts</div>
            <div><span>+</span> New tools we're testing</div>
            <div><span>+</span> Guest experts and occasional Nerd Nights</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="wrap free-cta rv">
          <p><strong>Use the free stuff. Steal the ideas. Put them to work.</strong><br>If you want the system and software, it's $99/month. If you want us to build it with you, there's the Academy.</p>
          <a class="btn btn-gold" href="https://community.gorenegades.com">Join the free community <span class="ar">→</span></a>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- DARIN / PHILOSOPHY -->
      <section class="sec sec-black">
        <div class="wrap darin rv">
          <div class="darin-photo">
            <img src="https://res.cloudinary.com/dhmzbmbgv/image/upload/v1779927635/qxbvr39vr04gclalfb9b.jpg" alt="Darin Rhodes" loading="lazy">
            <span class="tag">Darin Rhodes</span>
          </div>
          <div>
            <span class="ey">Why Marketing Renegades exists</span>
            <h2 class="disp">Useful ideas are good. <span class="g">Installed systems are better.</span></h2>
            <p>I've spent more than two decades building businesses in and around mortgage. I've taught, coached, marketed, experimented, bought software, ignored software, chased shiny objects, and learned the same lesson over and over: knowing what to do isn't the same as having a system that actually gets it done.</p>
            <p>My job here isn't to pretend I'm the world's foremost expert in every marketing tactic. It's to <strong>teach what I know, help people think clearly, facilitate the build, and bring in smart specialists when they're the better person to learn from.</strong></p>
            <div class="sig">
              <div><div class="nm">Darin Rhodes</div><div class="ti">Founder · Marketing Renegades</div></div>
              <a class="bd" href="/about">More about Darin →</a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- FINAL CTA -->
      <section class="final-home">
        <div class="wrap final-home-in rv">
          <span class="ey">You are probably closer than you think.</span>
          <h2 class="disp">Start with one system. <span>Make it consistent.</span></h2>
          <p>You don't need 37 new marketing tactics. You need a few useful things working together, every week, without relying entirely on memory and motivation.</p>
          <div class="hero-cta final-buttons">
            <a class="btn btn-gold" href="/crm">Get the $99 system <span class="ar">→</span></a>
            <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="https://community.gorenegades.com">Start free</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
    </main>

    <Footer />
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .home-hero{position:relative;overflow:hidden;padding:110px 0 92px;background:var(--black)}
  .home-glow{position:absolute;top:-280px;right:-180px;width:900px;height:900px;border-radius:50%;background:radial-gradient(circle,rgba(244,194,13,.16),rgba(244,194,13,.04) 42%,transparent 70%);pointer-events:none}
  .home-hero-in{position:relative;z-index:2}
  .home-hero .ey{margin-bottom:28px}
  .home-hero h1{font-size:clamp(68px,12vw,182px);max-width:9.5ch;margin:0;line-height:.82}
  .home-hero h1 span{display:block}
  .home-hero h1 .gold{color:var(--gold)}
  .price-line{font-family:var(--mono);font-weight:700;font-size:clamp(18px,2vw,25px);letter-spacing:.04em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--gold);margin-top:34px}
  .home-lead{font-size:clamp(20px,2.25vw,28px);line-height:1.4;max-width:900px;margin-top:22px;color:var(--white);letter-spacing:-.015em}
  .home-lead strong{color:var(--gold)}
  .hero-note{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:12px;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:.04em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--smoke-dim);margin-top:22px;max-width:720px}

  .consistency-list{margin-top:48px;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}
  .consistency-list>div{display:grid;grid-template-columns:72px 1fr;gap:20px;padding:20px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);align-items:center}
  .consistency-list span{font-family:var(--display);font-size:34px;line-height:1;color:var(--gold)}
  .consistency-list p{font-size:18px;color:var(--white)}
  .pullquote{margin-top:46px;padding:28px 30px;border-left:4px solid var(--gold);background:var(--black)}
  .pullquote p{font-size:20px;line-height:1.55;color:var(--smoke)}
  .pullquote strong{color:var(--white)}

  .section-intro{max-width:900px}
  .pod-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:18px;margin-top:54px}
  .pod-card{border:1px solid var(--line);background:var(--ink);padding:30px 28px;min-height:300px;transition:border-color .2s ease,transform .2s ease}
  .pod-card:hover{border-color:var(--gold);transform:translateY(-4px)}
  .pod-num{font-family:var(--display);font-size:46px;line-height:.8;color:var(--gold);margin-bottom:28px}
  .pod-card h3{font-family:var(--display);font-weight:400;text-transform:uppercase;font-size:30px;line-height:.95;letter-spacing:.01em}
  .pod-card p{font-size:15.5px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--smoke);margin-top:16px}

  .system-offer{padding:110px 0;background:var(--gold);color:var(--black)}
  .system-offer-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1.4fr) minmax(280px,.6fr);gap:80px;align-items:center}
  .system-offer .ey{color:#3a2d05}
  .system-offer h2{font-family:var(--display);font-weight:400;text-transform:uppercase;font-size:clamp(48px,6.5vw,92px);line-height:.9;margin-top:18px;max-width:11ch}
  .system-offer h2 span{color:var(--black);text-decoration:underline;text-decoration-thickness:4px;text-underline-offset:7px}
  .offer-lead{font-size:20px;line-height:1.55;margin-top:28px;max-width:720px}
  .offer-copy{font-size:17px;line-height:1.65;margin-top:18px;max-width:700px;color:#332a0b}
  .system-offer .btn-gold{background:var(--black);border-color:var(--black);color:var(--gold)}
  .system-offer .btn-gold:hover{background:transparent;color:var(--black);box-shadow:6px 6px 0 var(--black)}
  .price-card{border:3px solid var(--black);padding:38px 34px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.14)}
  .price-kicker{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:12px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.15em;text-transform:uppercase}
  .price{font-family:var(--display);font-size:118px;line-height:.8;margin-top:24px}
  .price span{font-size:48px;vertical-align:top;display:inline-block;margin-top:8px}
  .price-period{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:13px;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.08em;margin-top:12px}
  .price-rule{height:2px;background:var(--black);margin:28px 0}
  .price-card p{font-weight:600;font-size:17px;line-height:1.5}
  .price-note{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11px;line-height:1.5;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.06em;margin-top:22px}

  .academy-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.1fr .9fr;gap:80px;align-items:start}
  .academy-copy{font-size:18px;line-height:1.65;color:var(--smoke);margin:22px 0 34px;max-width:650px}
  .academy-points{border-top:1px solid var(--line)}
  .academy-points>div{display:grid;grid-template-columns:64px 1fr;gap:18px;padding:26px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
  .academy-points>div>span{font-family:var(--display);font-size:36px;line-height:.8;color:var(--gold)}
  .academy-points strong{display:block;font-size:18px;color:var(--white);margin-bottom:6px}
  .academy-points p{font-size:15px;line-height:1.55;color:var(--smoke)}

  .community-section{padding:110px 0;background:var(--ink)}
  .community-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:80px;align-items:start}
  .community-section h2{font-family:var(--display);font-weight:400;text-transform:uppercase;font-size:clamp(52px,7vw,100px);line-height:.88;margin-top:18px}
  .community-section h2 span{color:var(--gold)}
  .community-section p{font-size:18px;line-height:1.65;color:var(--smoke);margin-top:24px;max-width:560px}
  .free-list{border-top:1px solid var(--line)}
  .free-list div{font-size:18px;color:var(--white);padding:17px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
  .free-list span{font-family:var(--mono);font-weight:700;color:var(--gold);margin-right:12px}
  .free-cta{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:40px;margin-top:58px;padding-top:42px;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}
  .free-cta p{margin:0;max-width:720px}
  .free-cta strong{color:var(--white)}

  .sig .bd{text-decoration:none}

  .final-home{padding:115px 0 120px;text-align:center;background:var(--black);position:relative;overflow:hidden}
  .final-home:before{content:"";position:absolute;inset:0;background:radial-gradient(ellipse at center top,rgba(244,194,13,.13),transparent 62%);pointer-events:none}
  .final-home-in{position:relative;z-index:2;max-width:1000px}
  .final-home h2{font-family:var(--display);font-weight:400;text-transform:uppercase;font-size:clamp(54px,8vw,112px);line-height:.88;margin-top:20px}
  .final-home h2 span{display:block;color:var(--gold)}
  .final-home p{font-size:19px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--smoke);max-width:720px;margin:28px auto 36px}
  .final-buttons{justify-content:center}

  @media(max-width:980px){
    .pod-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}
    .system-offer-grid,.academy-grid,.community-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:50px}
    .price-card{max-width:430px}
  }
  @media(max-width:720px){
    .home-hero{padding:82px 0 72px}
    .home-hero h1{font-size:clamp(58px,18vw,100px)}
    .home-lead{font-size:20px}
    .pod-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}
    .pod-card{min-height:auto}
    .system-offer,.community-section{padding:82px 0}
    .system-offer h2{max-width:none}
    .free-cta{display:block}
    .free-cta .btn{margin-top:30px}
    .consistency-list>div{grid-template-columns:54px 1fr}
  }
</style>
